        "content": "[\n  {\n    \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/305189904\",\n    \"assets_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/305189904/assets\",\n    \"upload_url\": \"https://uploads.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/305189904/assets{?name,label}\",\n    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.92\",\n    \"id\": 305189904,\n    \"author\": {\n      \"login\": \"ashwin-ant\",\n      \"id\": 178951676,\n      \"node_id\": \"U_kgDOCqqV_A\",\n      \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?v=4\",\n      \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n      \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant\",\n      \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/ashwin-ant\",\n      \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/followers\",\n      \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/following{/other_user}\",\n      \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/gists{/gist_id}\",\n      \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n      \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/subscriptions\",\n      \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/orgs\",\n      \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/repos\",\n      \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/events{/privacy}\",\n      \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/received_events\",\n      \"type\": \"User\",\n      \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n      \"site_admin\": false\n    },\n    \"node_id\": \"RE_kwDON91aY84SMNQQ\",\n    \"tag_name\": \"v2.1.92\",\n    \"target_commitish\": \"main\",\n    \"name\": \"v2.1.92\",\n    \"draft\": false,\n    \"immutable\": false,\n    \"prerelease\": false,\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-04-04T00:41:56Z\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"2026-04-04T00:42:02Z\",\n    \"published_at\": \"2026-04-04T00:42:02Z\",\n    \"assets\": [\n\n    ],\n    \"tarball_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/tarball/v2.1.92\",\n    \"zipball_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/zipball/v2.1.92\",\n    \"body\": \"## What's changed\\n\\n- Added `forceRemoteSettingsRefresh` policy setting: when set, the CLI blocks startup until remote managed settings are freshly fetched, and exits if the fetch fails (fail-closed)\\n- Added interactive Bedrock setup wizard accessible from the login screen when selecting \\\"3rd-party platform\\\" — guides you through AWS authentication, region configuration, credential verification, and model pinning\\n- Added per-model and cache-hit breakdown to `/cost` for subscription users\\n- `/release-notes` is now an interactive version picker\\n- Remote Control session names now use your hostname as the default prefix (e.g. `myhost-graceful-unicorn`), overridable with `--remote-control-session-name-prefix`\\n- Pro users now see a footer hint when returning to a session after the prompt cache has expired, showing roughly how many tokens the next turn will send uncached\\n- Fixed subagent spawning permanently failing with \\\"Could not determine pane count\\\" after tmux windows are killed or renumbered during a long-running session\\n- Fixed prompt-type Stop hooks incorrectly failing when the small fast model returns `ok:false`, and restored `preventContinuation:true` semantics for non-Stop prompt-type hooks\\n- Fixed tool input validation failures when streaming emits array/object fields as JSON-encoded strings\\n- Fixed an API 400 error that could occur when extended thinking produced a whitespace-only text block alongside real content\\n- Fixed accidental feedback survey submissions from auto-pilot keypresses and consecutive-prompt digit collisions\\n- Fixed misleading \\\"esc to interrupt\\\" hint appearing alongside \\\"esc to clear\\\" when a text selection exists in fullscreen mode during processing\\n- Fixed Homebrew install update prompts to use the cask's release channel (`claude-code` → stable, `claude-code@latest` → latest)\\n- Fixed `ctrl+e` jumping to the end of the next line when already at end of line in multiline prompts\\n- Fixed an issue where the same message could appear at two positions when scrolling up in fullscreen mode (iTerm2, Ghostty, and other terminals with DEC 2026 support)\\n- Fixed idle-return \\\"/clear to save X tokens\\\" hint showing cumulative session tokens instead of current context size\\n- Fixed plugin MCP servers stuck \\\"connecting\\\" on session start when they duplicate a claude.ai connector that is unauthenticated\\n- Improved Write tool diff computation speed for large files (60% faster on files with tabs/`&`/`$`)\\n- Removed `/tag` command\\n- Removed `/vim` command (toggle vim mode via `/config` → Editor mode)\\n- Linux sandbox now ships the `apply-seccomp` helper in both npm and native builds, restoring unix-socket blocking for sandboxed commands\\n\",\n    \"reactions\": {\n      \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/305189904/reactions\",\n      \"total_count\": 88,\n      \"+1\": 38,\n      \"-1\": 0,\n      \"laugh\": 6,\n      \"hooray\": 10,\n      \"confused\": 0,\n      \"heart\": 14,\n      \"rocket\": 10,\n      \"eyes\": 10\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/304899951\",\n    \"assets_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/304899951/assets\",\n    \"upload_url\": \"https://uploads.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/304899951/assets{?name,label}\",\n    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.91\",\n    \"id\": 304899951,\n    \"author\": {\n      \"login\": \"ashwin-ant\",\n      \"id\": 178951676,\n      \"node_id\": \"U_kgDOCqqV_A\",\n      \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?v=4\",\